cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below, and link the canonical page."
title: FireApproved.com structured data
version: "2026.08.25"
date-released: "2026-08-25"
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: dataset
url: https://fireapproved.com
repository-code: https://github.com/grysngrhm-tech/fireapproved-data
abstract: >-
  Structured data from FireApproved.com, a citation directory for
  wildfire-resistant construction and plants: plant flammability evidence
  with the source's own wording preserved, and complete censuses of the
  CAL FIRE OSFM Building Materials Listing. Every status links to the
  source document it came from; classifications are computed from the
  cited evidence by a published rule, never hand-assigned.
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - defensible space
  - home hardening
  - plant flammability
  - building codes
  - wildland-urban interface
  - fire-resistant plants
  - open data
authors:
  - family-names: Graham
    given-names: Grayson
    website: https://fireapproved.com
